		<TD WIDTH="195" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Arial, Helvetica" SIZE="-1"><B>Teramenor's skills:</B><BR>Alcohol Tolerance - level 200<BR>Begging - level 121<BR>Brewing - level 135<BR>Fishing - level 101<BR>Jewelcraft - level 50<BR>Pottery - level 122<BR>Research - level 155<BR>Tailoring - level 30<BR></FONT></TD>
